  "title": "Festive season hiring: Here are 5 job roles likely to see strongest demand",
  "summary": "Delivery and warehouse roles are top employers' festive hiring demands, while workers seek higher pay, flexible hours and opportunities that could lead to long-term employment, an Indeed survey found. Employers start festive hiring early, look to retain workers beyond peak.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "India's white-collar hiring rose 14% in August, driven by sectors such as auto, healthcare, and retail, with a report showing a 15% growth in non-IT areas.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The overall Naukri JobSpeak Index reached 3,028, reflecting a significant increase compared to previous months.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Nearly seven in 10 employers began or expect to begin festive hiring by September",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
